  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"increase\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Increase count\">+1</button>\n      <button id=\"decrease\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Decrease count\">-1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML file with counter output and buttons."
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": "/* Pixel-style counter theme */\n:root {\n  --bg: #2b2b2b;\n  --card-bg: #3c3c3c;\n  --text: #f0f0f0;\n  --accent: #ffcc00;\n  --btn-bg: #5a5a5a;\n  --btn-hover: #7a7a7a;\n  --btn-active: #4a4a4a;\n  --focus: #ffcc00;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 1rem;\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border-radius: 0.75rem;\n  padding: 2rem;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  width: 100%;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 1.5rem;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.8rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.count {\n  font-size: 5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--text);\n  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  padding: 0.25rem 1rem;\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0.5rem;\n  min-width: 6rem;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 1rem;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\n  background: var(--btn-bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border: 2px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0.5rem;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.05s;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n  min-width: 5rem;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: var(--btn-hover);\n}\n\n.btn:active {\n  background: var(--btn-active);\n  transform: translateY(2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\n.btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--focus);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .count {\n    font-size: 3.5rem;\n  }\n  .btn {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;\n    min-width: 4rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": "Pixel-style theme with centered card, buttons, and responsive layout."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "// Pixel Counter logic\n(function() {\n  'use strict';\n\n  const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\n  const increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');\n  const decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');\n  const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n\n  let count = 0;\n\n  function updateDisplay() {\n    countEl.textContent = count;\n  }\n\n  increaseBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {\n    count += 1;\n    updateDisplay();\n  });\n\n  decreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {\n    count -= 1;\n    updateDisplay();\n  });\n\n  resetBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {\n    count = 0;\n    updateDisplay();\n  });\n\n  // Initialize display\n  updateDisplay();\n})();",
      "description": "Counter logic with event listeners for increase, decrease, and reset."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA simple offline pixel-style counter built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial value: 0\n- Buttons: Increase (+1), Decrease (-1), Reset (to 0)\n- Supports negative numbers\n- Keyboard-accessible with labeled buttons\n- No dependencies, no storage, no network requests\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click the buttons to change the count.\n\n## Controls\n\n- **Increase**: Adds 1 to the count.\n- **Decrease**: Subtracts 1 from the count.\n- **Reset**: Sets the count back to 0.\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- Buttons have `aria-label` attributes for screen readers.\n- The output element uses `aria-live=\"polite\"` to announce changes.\n- Focus states are visible for keyboard navigation.\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": "README with usage and accessibility details."
    }
  ]
